    "long_instructions": "## Debug a While Loop Flowchart\r\n\r\nThis flowchart models a while loop that keeps asking the user to guess the answer to the riddle. But for some reason the loop keeps running even when the answer is guessed...\r\n \r\nTrace through the **while loop** flowchart to find the **start condition**, **stop condition**, and **state variable**. Revise the flowchart by updating at least one of these values to ensure the loop runs correctly. ",
